    <string name="lemon_setup_need_games">A game dump you made: NSP, XCI or a dump folder</string>
    <string name="lemon_setup_need_firmware">Your console\'s firmware, for the games\' fonts</string>
    <string name="lemon_setup_privacy">Keys, firmware and games stay on this device. Nothing is uploaded.</string>
    <string name="lemon_setup_access_title">Allow file access</string>
    <string name="lemon_setup_access_body">The app reads your game dump where it is on the storage and keeps its saves in its own folder. A .nup file works without this; a dump folder can also be copied into the app instead.</string>
